					Id.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					258d
				</span></i>
			; <i>clause</i> of a law, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.127
			</span></i> (s.v.l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄξιον
			συγγράμματος</span> not worth a <i>note</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.909
			</span></i>.</div>
